Parts of this code will re-implement Mu2e Offline (https://github.com/Mu2e/Offline, Apache-2.0) tracker modules
(MakeStrawGasSteps, StrawDigisFromStrawGasSteps, StrawHitReco, CosmicReco) and KinKal
(https://github.com/KFTrack/KinKal, Apache-2.0) fits.

Mu2e-internal inputs (tracker conditions, alignment and calibration tables, detector data) and physics results are
not part of this repository and must not be added to it.
